---
title: Thumbnails
description: One system, several styles. Each is the default thumbnail with one thing changed, so a channel of mixed films still reads as one channel.
eyebrow: Content creation · Thumbnails
source: src/components/studio.css
---
<p>Every style is the <a href="/content-creation/youtube/thumbnail/">default</a> with one change — the picture takes over, a numeral stands behind the words, a code window replaces the picture, the ground goes dark. Add a style the same way: one modifier class on <code>im-studio-thumb</code>, one thing different.</p>
<ul>
	<li><a href="/content-creation/thumbnails/default/">Film</a> — the person on the right, the accent behind the shoulder, a kicker and a title.</li>
	<li><a href="/content-creation/thumbnails/live/">Live stream</a> — the same, on a dark ground, with the live dot and the day and time.</li>
	<li><a href="/content-creation/thumbnails/travel/">Travel</a> — the place is the picture; the person small and ringed; the price in pixel type.</li>
	<li><a href="/content-creation/thumbnails/tutorial/">Tutorial</a> — dark, the person, and one line of code where the kicker was.</li>
	<li><a href="/content-creation/thumbnails/series/">Series</a> — the episode numeral, huge and faint, behind the person.</li>
	<li><a href="/content-creation/thumbnails/short/">Short</a> — 1080 × 1920, the person fills it, the words at the foot.</li>
</ul>
